y-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:4e059317a9472dde39f6f621f5a9891b1e2c3c8d6cbe599447b235de04de4d54","file":"preprints/Bounded-recovery-for-modular-spectral-averages-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":121,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2362efed928e9bae84481c2b6228241fe9cfe37a08bd13477462ea209cfba339","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Bounded-recovery-for-modular-spectral-averages-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:4e059317a9472dde39f6f621f5a9891b1e2c3c8d6cbe599447b235de04de4d54","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Bounded-recovery-for-modular-spectral-averages-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L121"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:rigidity}\nLet $M$ be a von Neumann algebra with a faithful normal state $\\phi$ such\nthat $M_\\phi=\\C1$. Let $b:\\R\\curvearrowright M$ be a continuous\n$\\phi$-preserving action. Suppose that, for every $s\\in\\R$, every uniformly\nbounded sequence $(w_n)$ in $M$, and every $a\\in M$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:flow-property}\n  \\norm{\\phi w_n-e^s w_n\\phi}_{M_*}\\longrightarrow0\n  \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n  w_na-b_s(a)w_n\\longrightarrow0\n  \\quad\\text{strongly}.\n\\end{equation}\nThen $b_s=\\id_M$ for every $s\\in\\R$."}
